1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,170
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,120
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:15,850
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,010
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,000
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,250
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,520
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,480
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,480
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:44,850
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:47,840
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,690
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,040
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,210
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,290
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,170
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,610
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,050
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,130
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,250
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,210
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:32,850
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,480
Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:01:51,600 --> 00:01:53,200
After the tribulation,

25
00:01:53,560 --> 00:01:57,200
the fog in the Sea of Devils dissipated

26
00:01:57,880 --> 00:02:01,640
and a strange black rain began falling.

27
00:02:03,800 --> 00:02:06,800
Many sects were infected by it.

28
00:02:07,320 --> 00:02:10,570
The Spirit Beasts mutated,

29
00:02:10,800 --> 00:02:12,080
increasing in strength.

30
00:02:12,280 --> 00:02:14,240
They even attacked the sects.

31
00:02:15,120 --> 00:02:16,080
Now,

32
00:02:16,400 --> 00:02:21,280
chaos reigns in the Sea of Devils.

33
00:02:30,990 --> 00:02:31,720
Sect Leader,

34
00:02:31,840 --> 00:02:34,450
you asked for a map of ancient teleportation formations.

35
00:02:34,680 --> 00:02:35,840
I found a place that has one !

36
00:02:35,960 --> 00:02:38,010
It's sold in Lian Mo City.

37
00:02:38,680 --> 00:02:39,990
If I want to return to Zhao,

38
00:02:40,760 --> 00:02:42,360
I have to cross the Sea of Devils.

39
00:02:42,790 --> 00:02:44,400
But this place is huge

40
00:02:44,840 --> 00:02:47,200
and conflicts have been going on for years.

41
00:02:47,400 --> 00:02:48,980
The fastest way to travel

42
00:02:49,290 --> 00:02:51,600
is ancient teleportation formations.

43
00:02:52,480 --> 00:02:55,440
I need to find a map of these formations.

44
00:03:05,240 --> 00:03:07,400
Ma Jinrong\NPoison Devil Palace Disciple\NLate stage Core Formation

45
00:03:05,240 --> 00:03:07,400
Shangguan Cai\NPoison Devil Palace Disciple\NLate stage Core Formation

46
00:03:11,990 --> 00:03:14,320
There really is an Eight-clawed Beast here !

47
00:03:14,400 --> 00:03:16,880
I've been tracking this beast for months.

48
00:03:17,040 --> 00:03:18,560
But my cultivation is too low

49
00:03:18,560 --> 00:03:20,280
to catch this beast.

50
00:03:20,360 --> 00:03:22,680
I will have to bother the two of you.

51
00:03:23,080 --> 00:03:23,770
Of course,

52
00:03:24,070 --> 00:03:26,180
Brother Qiu is only at Middle stage Core Formation.

53
00:03:26,600 --> 00:03:29,560
Just leave the matter of killing this beast to us.

54
00:03:33,250 --> 00:03:36,520
If killing this beast didn't require freshly made poison,

55
00:03:36,760 --> 00:03:38,560
I wouldn't have had to rely on Juniors

56
00:03:38,670 --> 00:03:40,600
with my Nascent Soul cultivation.

57
00:03:42,440 --> 00:03:43,240
Brother Wang,

58
00:03:43,820 --> 00:03:47,600
After swallowing that Nascent Soul, I successfully established mine.

59
00:03:48,080 --> 00:03:50,000
I don't know if you've succeeded.

60
00:03:50,310 --> 00:03:51,600
But if you haven't,

61
00:03:51,920 --> 00:03:54,000
when we meet again,

62
00:03:54,440 --> 00:03:56,560
I will have to pay you back.

63
00:04:03,010 --> 00:04:06,760
After you finish the poison and kill this beast,

64
00:04:07,240 --> 00:04:09,200
I'll kill you both.

65
00:04:11,790 --> 00:04:14,600
Huh ? I have met an old friend.

66
00:04:18,520 --> 00:04:19,320
Go !

67
00:04:32,440 --> 00:04:33,240
Impossible...

68
00:04:37,420 --> 00:04:39,000
Such a powerful Divine Sense...

69
00:04:39,550 --> 00:04:42,200
Could it be a monster of the Soul Formation level ?

70
00:04:42,710 --> 00:04:43,800
I've been looking for you.

71
00:04:44,480 --> 00:04:46,020
Long time no see.

72
00:04:47,780 --> 00:04:49,760
Does Senior know me ?

73
00:04:54,040 --> 00:04:55,560
It's you !

74
00:04:55,720 --> 00:04:57,880
Brother Qiu is really in a good mood.

75
00:04:57,880 --> 00:04:59,330
With your Nascent Soul cultivation,

76
00:04:59,600 --> 00:05:01,760
you're playing around with 2 Juniors...

77
00:05:02,240 --> 00:05:03,400
Very interesting.

78
00:05:04,500 --> 00:05:05,760
He's Nascent Soul ?

79
00:05:06,160 --> 00:05:09,040
If we didn't give the beast to him,

80
00:05:09,240 --> 00:05:11,440
he would've certainly killed us !

81
00:05:14,120 --> 00:05:15,920
Thank you for your guidance Senior.

82
00:05:23,340 --> 00:05:24,240
Leaving ?

83
00:05:33,520 --> 00:05:35,280
These two juniors seem to be

84
00:05:35,280 --> 00:05:37,480
from the Poison Devil Palace.

85
00:05:38,200 --> 00:05:39,960
That sect takes good care of their disciples.

86
00:05:40,190 --> 00:05:41,020
Brother Qiu,

87
00:05:41,400 --> 00:05:43,400
you have to be careful in the future.

88
00:05:44,190 --> 00:05:47,680
That guy is a core disciple of the Poison Devil Palace

89
00:05:47,890 --> 00:05:49,400
If he really runs away,

90
00:05:49,800 --> 00:05:52,760
I will have problems in the future

91
00:05:52,930 --> 00:05:54,200
This guy...

92
00:05:55,190 --> 00:05:57,760
With their Late stage Core Formation speed,

93
00:05:57,980 --> 00:05:59,960
if Brother Qiu quickly chases after them,

94
00:06:01,140 --> 00:06:02,850
you might still catch up.

95
00:06:04,580 --> 00:06:05,400
Brother Wang,

96
00:06:05,960 --> 00:06:08,760
say what's on your mind.

97
00:06:09,170 --> 00:06:10,760
Although our relation isn't deep

98
00:06:10,840 --> 00:06:13,080
we still have been through a bit together.

99
00:06:13,760 --> 00:06:15,840
Do you have a map of the Sea of Devils ?

100
00:06:18,480 --> 00:06:19,480
I don't have one.

101
00:06:19,830 --> 00:06:21,400
But if Brother Wang wants one,

102
00:06:21,600 --> 00:06:23,560
you can go to the treasure pavilions in the cities.

103
00:06:23,680 --> 00:06:25,160
You might have some luck there.

104
00:06:25,720 --> 00:06:28,600
Then Brother Qiu should come with me to the city.

105
00:06:28,910 --> 00:06:30,960
We'll buy a map together.

106
00:06:31,360 --> 00:06:34,000
You can chase them after I obtain a map.

107
00:06:34,760 --> 00:06:37,960
He has forced me into a situation where I need to kill them

108
00:06:38,000 --> 00:06:39,400
but he's blocking me.

109
00:06:39,840 --> 00:06:41,120
Now that I'm in this situation,

110
00:06:41,120 --> 00:06:42,160
I can't wait,

111
00:06:42,280 --> 00:06:43,560
I can only comply.

112
00:06:44,080 --> 00:06:45,800
That's truly a great scheme...

113
00:06:51,140 --> 00:06:52,640
All my knowledge of the Sea of Devils

114
00:06:52,640 --> 00:06:55,000
from all the years I have traveled

115
00:06:55,040 --> 00:06:56,960
is compiled in this jade.

116
00:06:57,240 --> 00:06:58,880
There might be some mistakes,

117
00:06:58,920 --> 00:07:00,080
but not too many.

118
00:07:00,270 --> 00:07:01,000
Brother Wang,

119
00:07:01,380 --> 00:07:02,480
If there's nothing else,

120
00:07:02,680 --> 00:07:03,760
I'm leaving.

121
00:07:04,320 --> 00:07:05,120
Thank you.

122
00:07:06,920 --> 00:07:08,000
You're not going to check it ?

123
00:07:08,960 --> 00:07:10,160
Do I need to ?

124
00:07:12,480 --> 00:07:13,280
Brother Wang,

125
00:07:13,640 --> 00:07:16,000
I wouldn't give you false information.

126
00:07:16,200 --> 00:07:17,960
You can rest assured.

127
00:07:18,970 --> 00:07:21,280
I need to gather multiple maps

128
00:07:22,000 --> 00:07:23,680
to cross reference them

129
00:07:24,280 --> 00:07:26,200
and find out the real information.

130
00:07:27,120 --> 00:07:30,200
7 days later

131
00:07:33,730 --> 00:07:36,000
There are so many mutants in the Sea of Devils,

132
00:07:36,110 --> 00:07:37,640
yet this guy is just strolling around.

133
00:07:38,120 --> 00:07:40,520
How long until we reach Lian Mo City ?

134
00:07:41,340 --> 00:07:42,600
Something's wrong here.

135
00:07:43,880 --> 00:07:46,000
I don't hear any sound.

136
00:08:20,320 --> 00:08:21,760
Underworld Ice Flame,

137
00:08:21,880 --> 00:08:22,600
emerge !

138
00:08:41,420 --> 00:08:43,600
The beast hiding in this mountain

139
00:08:43,960 --> 00:08:45,280
can take a humanoid shape ?

140
00:08:46,000 --> 00:08:46,880
Interesting...

141
00:08:47,930 --> 00:08:49,680
Although the beast isn't strong,

142
00:08:50,360 --> 00:08:52,360
I can help it cultivate to grow in strength.

143
00:08:52,680 --> 00:08:53,240
Break !

144
00:08:59,600 --> 00:09:00,790
A mosquito beast ?

145
00:09:01,140 --> 00:09:04,400
Tu Si was almost killed by their encirclement before...

146
00:09:05,040 --> 00:09:07,480
This one must be of the same race.

147
00:09:15,110 --> 00:09:16,360
I am here !

148
00:09:18,450 --> 00:09:19,680
What the hell is this ?

149
00:09:20,070 --> 00:09:21,600
Why is it even uglier than the ape ?

150
00:09:22,140 --> 00:09:24,560
This new devil seems dumb.

151
00:09:25,240 --> 00:09:28,040
I'll let him do the dirty work.

152
00:09:28,200 --> 00:09:30,360
If it turns out he's useless

153
00:09:30,360 --> 00:09:32,000
I'll just clean up after him.

154
00:09:37,560 --> 00:09:38,800
Such speed !

155
00:09:47,890 --> 00:09:49,000
So powerful !

156
00:09:49,600 --> 00:09:51,200
If it weren't for this stupid ape,

157
00:09:51,210 --> 00:09:53,480
I wouldn't have come out to look for trouble.

158
00:09:55,580 --> 00:09:57,000
So it's hard huh ?

159
00:09:57,440 --> 00:10:00,800
I want to see how he will capture this thing.

160
00:10:01,120 --> 00:10:01,920
Split !

161
00:10:04,930 --> 00:10:05,760
Illusion !

162
00:10:16,040 --> 00:10:17,760
So it will fight itself.

163
00:10:18,000 --> 00:10:20,200
Master always has good ideas !

164
00:10:29,250 --> 00:10:31,800
It seems that it can not just attack with its dart,

165
00:10:34,290 --> 00:10:37,400
but it can also attack with its mouth.

166
00:10:43,640 --> 00:10:46,080
You cannot run away !

167
00:10:50,560 --> 00:10:53,200
Master is getting more and more terrifying...

168
00:11:10,880 --> 00:11:11,800
Ridiculous.

169
00:11:24,000 --> 00:11:26,480
Master, you are too generous !

170
00:11:26,480 --> 00:11:28,800
You've given him too many treasures to absorb !

171
00:11:40,250 --> 00:11:41,080
Let's go.

172
00:11:44,960 --> 00:11:46,480
How about 3 mid quality spirit stones ?

173
00:11:46,720 --> 00:11:47,680
I can't go cheaper.

174
00:11:47,720 --> 00:11:48,590
Let's talk later.

175
00:11:46,000 --> 00:11:49,240
Lian Mo City\NSea of Devils

176
00:11:49,040 --> 00:11:50,800
Long time no see, fellow cultivator.

177
00:11:51,970 --> 00:11:54,360
The Sea isn't very calm lately.

178
00:11:55,240 --> 00:11:56,200
This is a special item...

179
00:11:56,200 --> 00:11:59,680
These artifacts are made from middle grade Spirit Beast bones.

180
00:11:59,830 --> 00:12:01,200
Especially this bell,

181
00:12:01,400 --> 00:12:03,600
it was made out of beast ear drums and wings.

182
00:12:03,720 --> 00:12:04,680
It is extraordinary.

183
00:12:04,840 --> 00:12:06,800
I exchange for spirit stones.

184
00:12:07,320 --> 00:12:10,360
I want the bell, for 30 spirit stones ?

185
00:12:10,680 --> 00:12:11,320
Sold.

186
00:12:13,160 --> 00:12:14,160
Next person.

187
00:12:14,480 --> 00:12:15,800
This crystal furnace

188
00:12:16,040 --> 00:12:17,600
can be exchanged for high grade pills.

189
00:12:18,060 --> 00:12:19,760
I am looking for secret cultivation techniques !

190
00:12:20,240 --> 00:12:24,000
I have a book about the secret water sealing pills.

191
00:12:24,440 --> 00:12:27,000
This gourd can transmit the voice,

192
00:12:27,000 --> 00:12:28,480
I sell it for 100 spirit stones.

193
00:12:27,000 --> 00:12:28,840
Among all those items

194
00:12:28,840 --> 00:12:30,960
maybe one can sell for a high price.

195
00:12:30,960 --> 00:12:32,200
Fellow cultivator, I'm in !

196
00:12:32,760 --> 00:12:34,760
It turns there are many strong people hidden here.

197
00:12:34,540 --> 00:12:36,040
Fellow Daoist, don't compete with me !

198
00:12:36,140 --> 00:12:37,160
Next person.

199
00:12:40,080 --> 00:12:44,560
I will trade sea beast cores for a map of ancient teleportation formations,

200
00:12:44,560 --> 00:12:45,800
the more complete, the better.

201
00:12:51,090 --> 00:12:51,840
Little friend,

202
00:12:52,150 --> 00:12:56,280
this kind of high quality map is invaluable in the Sea of Devils.

203
00:12:56,600 --> 00:12:59,200
It will cost 1000 high quality spirit stones

204
00:12:59,560 --> 00:13:03,000
plus some of your items, it might be difficult for you.

205
00:13:03,480 --> 00:13:04,480
A thousand ?

206
00:13:04,800 --> 00:13:06,400
Who has this much ?

207
00:13:06,520 --> 00:13:07,200
Yeah right ?

208
00:13:07,840 --> 00:13:09,880
Then I'll offer a top grade spirit stone.

209
00:13:10,080 --> 00:13:11,700
Does anyone have a map ?

210
00:13:11,280 --> 00:13:12,240
Top quality ?!

211
00:13:12,240 --> 00:13:13,080
I heard it wrong.

212
00:13:13,080 --> 00:13:14,600
A top quality spirit stone...

213
00:13:14,590 --> 00:13:15,200
No way !

214
00:13:15,340 --> 00:13:16,600
Aren't they extinct ?

215
00:13:25,440 --> 00:13:27,000
Is this a top quality spirit stone ?

216
00:13:32,330 --> 00:13:33,650
Unfortunately I don't have a map...

217
00:13:34,440 --> 00:13:35,400
Next person.

218
00:13:37,790 --> 00:13:38,600
Fellow cultivator,

219
00:13:39,770 --> 00:13:42,000
I have what you're looking for.

220
00:13:42,830 --> 00:13:44,640
But with the top quality spirit stone,

221
00:13:45,360 --> 00:13:47,040
I want one more thing in exchange.

222
00:13:48,000 --> 00:13:48,970
First, the map.

223
00:13:51,880 --> 00:13:55,040
This map not only records the teleportation formations

224
00:13:55,240 --> 00:13:57,480
but also how damaged they are.

225
00:13:58,400 --> 00:13:59,280
What else do you need ?

226
00:14:00,040 --> 00:14:02,400
I want you to kill someone.

227
00:14:02,760 --> 00:14:03,800
What cultivation level ?

228
00:14:04,240 --> 00:14:06,180
Peak Late stage Nascent Soul,

229
00:14:06,360 --> 00:14:07,800
Half-Step Soul Formation.

230
00:14:09,120 --> 00:14:09,920
Lead the way.

231
00:14:16,750 --> 00:14:17,550
Fellow cultivator,

232
00:14:17,580 --> 00:14:19,530
this person is nearby.

233
00:14:20,280 --> 00:14:21,400
You will lay in ambush.

234
00:14:21,840 --> 00:14:23,160
When I invite him out,

235
00:14:23,320 --> 00:14:24,960
you attack.

236
00:14:24,960 --> 00:14:25,720
What's wrong ?

237
00:14:31,920 --> 00:14:33,160
You bastard !

238
00:14:33,240 --> 00:14:34,600
I'll kill you !

239
00:14:34,840 --> 00:14:36,000
You can all come out.

240
00:14:40,910 --> 00:14:42,800
When did you find out ?

241
00:14:43,320 --> 00:14:44,800
When we arrived here.

242
00:14:46,640 --> 00:14:48,160
You are smart.

243
00:14:48,760 --> 00:14:50,200
But it's too late.

244
00:14:50,520 --> 00:14:52,080
This place is too remote

245
00:14:52,120 --> 00:14:53,360
so no one can help you.

246
00:14:53,360 --> 00:14:54,200
You are...

247
00:14:57,360 --> 00:14:59,000
Go together, kill him !

248
00:15:13,360 --> 00:15:17,000
This sword sheath is exactly the same as the one I used in the past.

249
00:15:17,800 --> 00:15:19,840
Is there more of these ?

250
00:15:29,280 --> 00:15:30,480
It has a strong killing intent.

251
00:15:32,480 --> 00:15:35,200
The energy is sealed in the sheath.

252
00:15:35,720 --> 00:15:37,240
If I push the sword a third of the way in

253
00:15:37,310 --> 00:15:39,200
it can release this much energy.

254
00:15:39,720 --> 00:15:42,000
If I can sheathe it entirely...

255
00:15:42,400 --> 00:15:44,320
Its strength will be tremendous.

256
00:15:54,840 --> 00:15:55,760
Spot on.

257
00:16:30,800 --> 00:16:32,340
Take this, and this,

258
00:16:32,360 --> 00:16:34,320
and this spiced beef, take all of it !

259
00:16:33,990 --> 00:16:35,560
outstanding form and spirit.

260
00:16:37,360 --> 00:16:39,160
Blood for blood.

261
00:16:39,160 --> 00:16:40,920
I will wipe out your Wang Family

262
00:16:41,240 --> 00:16:43,000
to avenge my grandson Teng Li !

263
00:16:46,820 --> 00:16:47,800
Wang Lin,

264
00:16:47,960 --> 00:16:49,880
look how kind I am !

265
00:16:50,680 --> 00:16:53,000
I let you reunite with your parents...

266
00:16:53,730 --> 00:16:55,080
I have waited for this day

267
00:16:55,720 --> 00:16:57,520
for 400 years.

268
00:16:58,360 --> 00:16:59,200
Zhao...

269
00:16:59,880 --> 00:17:01,080
I'm coming back !

270
00:17:13,560 --> 00:17:17,440
I've had my share of wounds,

271
00:17:15,600 --> 00:17:17,440
now I want to fight back.

272
00:17:17,520 --> 00:17:21,000
Is my destiny a wall of restrictions

273
00:17:21,080 --> 00:17:26,920
that's blocking all my hopes

274
00:17:23,960 --> 00:17:26,920
for life ?

275
00:17:28,720 --> 00:17:32,680
My flesh and blood witnessed the past,

276
00:17:30,440 --> 00:17:32,680
my adversity pushed me to brave the waves.

277
00:17:33,000 --> 00:17:36,080
How do you navigate through the years passing by ?

278
00:17:36,440 --> 00:17:42,080
Nirvana and rebirth are no longer

279
00:17:39,160 --> 00:17:42,080
out of reach.

280
00:17:43,440 --> 00:17:47,560
Immortals

281
00:17:44,480 --> 00:17:47,560
are obsessed with delusions of grandeur.

282
00:17:47,840 --> 00:17:51,600
Renegades

283
00:17:48,600 --> 00:17:51,600
seek to crush the impermanence of the heavens.

284
00:17:51,600 --> 00:17:55,440
Don't tell me that I overestimate myself

285
00:17:53,550 --> 00:17:55,440
and that the path to revenge leads to hell

286
00:17:55,680 --> 00:17:59,560
because I don't see the harm in that.

287
00:18:01,560 --> 00:18:07,360
My new body opens its eyes

288
00:18:04,080 --> 00:18:07,360
and awakens from its dream.

289
00:18:07,480 --> 00:18:14,920
I have overcome many trials

290
00:18:09,600 --> 00:18:14,920
to get this body back.

291
00:18:15,120 --> 00:18:22,560
No matter how many endless dark nights go by,

292
00:18:19,160 --> 00:18:22,560
I can still see.

293
00:18:22,960 --> 00:18:31,920
By sticking to this thought, I will get it done

294
00:18:26,920 --> 00:18:31,920
by my own hands.

295
00:18:47,360 --> 00:18:53,320
Returning to my body opened my eyes,

296
00:18:50,080 --> 00:18:53,320
I need to continue my Immortal journey.

297
00:18:53,320 --> 00:19:00,880
With a flick of a finger,

298
00:18:54,760 --> 00:19:00,880
only my indomitable heart remains.

299
00:19:00,920 --> 00:19:10,280
Life and death trials temper me, I am not afraid of losing my soul.

300
00:19:06,880 --> 00:19:10,280
Even if there are countless tribulations and hardships.

301
00:19:10,520 --> 00:19:18,120
Overcome this fate, smash through the obstacles,

302
00:19:13,040 --> 00:19:18,120
like the descent of a god.
